      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Samuel Moelius",
      "date": "2026-06-28T13:48:47",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 dualpi2 qdisc（实现 DualPI2 AQM 算法的 Linux 排队规则）中一个分类状态污染的 bug。原代码在 TC 过滤器分类未命中时，没有重置 skb 上先前保存的分类标记（cb->classified），导致入队路径可能依据旧分类结果（如 L4S 或优先级）做出错误的调度决策。修复方法是在 dualpi2_skb_classify 函数入口处将 cb->classified 初始化为 DUALPI2_C_CLASSIC，使过滤器未命中时自然回退到默认类别，避免残留状态干扰后续处理，同时不影响 ECN 检测和过滤器成功匹配对结果的覆盖。",
      "tags": [
        "包处理",
        "性能",
        "TCP/IP"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14648703,
      "title": "[v3] net/sched: act_nat: only rewrite IPv4 packets",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260628132029.2209612.f2aaf6467355.act-nat-non-ipv4@trailofbits.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260628132029.2209612.f2aaf6467355.act-nat-non-ipv4@trailofbits.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260628132029.2209612.f2aaf6467355.act-nat-non-ipv4@trailofbits.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "08a911f4dea1aafde942b28995db9d981e5df611",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Samuel Moelius",
      "date": "2026-06-28T13:20:30",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 net/sched 中 act_nat（无状态 NAT 动作）的一处安全缺陷。act_nat 在执行 NAT 改写前直接按 IPv4 头部解析报文，未校验 skb->protocol，可能将非 IPv4 报文（如 ARP、IPv6 等）的载荷误解析为 IPv4 头，并基于无关字节篡改包内容。补丁在拉取 IPv4 头之前增加 skb->protocol == ETH_P_IP 的判断，仅对真正的 IPv4 报文执行 NAT；硬件加速剥离 VLAN 后网络头已指向 IPv4 的报文仍可正常处理，而未做偏移调整的 inline VLAN 报文则被正确拒绝，从而将 NAT 行为与其文档定义的 IPv4 协议范围对齐。",
      "tags": [
        "包处理",
        "Linux内核网络",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14648653,
      "title": "[net,1/1] tcp: bound SYN-ACK timers to reqsk timeout range",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/02e24eb83639e9d7ecc623f000c60254bb5c40a5.1782643946.git.roxy520tt@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/02e24eb83639e9d7ecc623f000c60254bb5c40a5.1782643946.git.roxy520tt@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/02e24eb83639e9d7ecc623f000c60254bb5c40a5.1782643946.git.roxy520tt@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "ea013624c18f97e0ebe3320fd89341faaedc5dab",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Ren Wei",
      "date": "2026-06-28T11:42:28",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 TCP request socket 定时器中由过大重试/延迟接受值引发的位移越界问题。tcp_reqsk_timeout() 会对 req->timeout 按 req->num_timeout 做左移计算超时，若 num_timeout 过大或 timeout 数值过大，会导致移位计数超出有效范围，产生未定义行为。补丁引入 MAX_TCP_SYNACK_RETRIES=63 上限，限制 tcp_synack_retries 与 Fast Open 重试次数，在常规 request socket 定时器路径中对 icsk_syn_retries 与 rskq_defer_accept 实际生效值做 clamp，并将超时计算改为新的 tcp_reqsk_timeout_sk()，在移位前先做饱和判断，避免溢出或非法移位。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "Socket",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14648645,
