      "id": 14648421,
      "title": "[net] net: usb: net1080: validate packet_len before pad-byte access in rx_fixup",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260627212854.4025016-1-xmei5@asu.edu",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260627212854.4025016-1-xmei5@asu.edu/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260627212854.4025016-1-xmei5@asu.edu/mbox/",
      "hash": "0cf7528f11a41d80ab052a9b88125393d611fe19",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Xiang Mei",
      "date": "2026-06-27T21:28:54",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 USB 网络驱动 net1080 中 net1080_rx_fixup() 函数的越界读取漏洞。原代码仅将设备提供的 packet_len 与 NC_MAX_PACKET 做上界比较，当 packet_len 为偶数时立即访问 skb->data[packet_len] 检查 pad 字节，但此时 skb->len 尚未校验。恶意设备可发送短帧并声明较大的偶数 packet_len（如 0x4000），导致 pad 字节读取越界，触发 KASAN slab-out-of-bounds 错误。修复方案是在偶数长度分支中新增边界检查，确保 packet_len 小于 skb->len 后再访问 pad 字节，否则丢弃帧并递增 rx_frame_errors 统计。该改动保证合法偶数长度帧（skb->len == packet_len + 1，含一个 pad 字节）正常处理，仅拦截异常帧。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14648410,
      "title": "[net] usbnet: gl620a: fix out-of-bounds read in genelink_rx_fixup()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260627205353.4000788-1-xmei5@asu.edu",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260627205353.4000788-1-xmei5@asu.edu/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260627205353.4000788-1-xmei5@asu.edu/mbox/",
      "hash": "67df53a9019f5b1dc402cda63874ab8325317f41",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Xiang Mei",
      "date": "2026-06-27T20:53:53",
      "summary": "修复 GL620A USB 网卡驱动中 genelink_rx_fixup() 函数的越界读取漏洞。该函数在拆分聚合 RX 帧时，仅以 GL_MAX_PACKET_LEN (1514) 作为每个包长度的上限，从未与实际接收的字节数进行比较。恶意设备可发送短 URB 数据但在头部声明较大包长，导致 skb_put_data() 越界拷贝相邻 slab 内容至网络栈，造成内核堆信息泄露，且无需特权即可触发。修复方法是将 skb_pull() 移到数据拷贝之前并检查其返回值：skb_pull 本身会校验请求长度是否超出缓冲区，若不足则返回 NULL，从而及时终止处理，避免越界访问。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    }
