      "submitter": "Bryam Vargas",
      "date": "2026-06-25T09:51:20",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 net/sched/sch_multiq 中子队列出队时的 desync bug。当 multiq 的子 qdisc 是 non-work-conserving 类型时，multiq_peek() 会把 skb 暂存到子 qdisc 的 gso_skb 中，若随后直接调用 qdisc->dequeue() 会取到不同的 skb，破坏子 qdisc 的 qlen/backlog 状态；与 tbf+peek 多级组合时还可能因空链表重入导致 NULL 解引用 softirq 内核 panic。改为统一调用 qdisc_dequeue_peeked()，对 work-conserving 子 qdisc 是 no-op，对 non-work-conserving 则正确取回 peek 的 skb，与 sch_prio、sch_red、sch_sbf 保持一致。",
      "tags": [
        "包处理",
        "性能",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14644584,
      "title": "[1/2] net/sched: sch_taprio: Replace direct dequeue call with peek and qdisc_dequeue_peeked",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260625-b4-disp-31bcb279-v1-1-85c40b83c529@proton.me",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260625-b4-disp-31bcb279-v1-1-85c40b83c529@proton.me/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260625-b4-disp-31bcb279-v1-1-85c40b83c529@proton.me/mbox/",
      "hash": "44c2a9a61363e45e8edc483b4b46620d997d81df",
      "commitRef": "e056e1dfcddca877dd46d704e8ec9860cfc9ec44",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Bryam Vargas",
      "date": "2026-06-25T09:51:19",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 taprio 调度器在软件路径下与非工作守恒子 qdisc（如 qfq）交互时的内核崩溃问题。原代码在 peek 之后直接调用 child->ops->dequeue()，会绕过子 qdisc 通过 gso_skb 缓存的已 peek 报文，导致该 skb 被孤立、子 qdisc 的 qlen/backlog 状态错乱。补丁将直接 dequeue 替换为 qdisc_dequeue_peeked() 辅助函数，优先取回子 qdisc 缓存的 peeked skb，对工作守恒子 qdisc 无影响，同时保证 gated 路径正确消费预算内已计费的报文，避免 NULL 指针解引用导致 softirq 上下文 panic。",
      "tags": [
        "TC",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
