    {
      "id": 14643691,
      "title": "[net,1/4] net: turn the rx_mode work into a generic netdev_work facility",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260624182018.2445732-2-kuba@kernel.org",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624182018.2445732-2-kuba@kernel.org/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624182018.2445732-2-kuba@kernel.org/mbox/",
      "hash": "53b26ddcc33bc06db3bf28b3ae868cecd5f67d1c",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Jakub Kicinski",
      "date": "2026-06-24T18:20:15",
      "summary": "该补丁将原本专用于 rx_mode 更新（网卡接收模式/多播过滤设置）的 workqueue 机制重构为通用的 netdev_work 框架。原先每个网络设备只能通过单一全局 work item 执行 ndo_set_rx_mode_async() 回调，新设计支持多种 'core' 事件类型，RX_MODE 作为第一种事件被纳入。新增 net/core/netdev_work.c 文件，引入 work_node、work_tracker、work_core_pending 等字段替换旧的 rx_mode 字段，未来还将允许驱动自定义并调度自己的事件。该改动在 RTNL 和 ops 锁保护下执行，为驱动提供了更灵活的异步任务调度基础设施，同时减少了 dev_addr_lists.c 中的重复逻辑。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 12
    },
    {
      "id": 14643472,
      "title": "[net,v3,09/11] rxrpc: Fix socket notification race",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260624163819.3017002-10-dhowells@redhat.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624163819.3017002-10-dhowells@redhat.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624163819.3017002-10-dhowells@redhat.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "0c87bbcce19f8a3918597811d06a7d2f538ad1cc",
      "commitRef": "e66f8f32f50116670dbbee5bc9e692cd2cd0c8f8",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "David Howells",
      "date": "2026-06-24T16:38:16",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 rxrpc 协议栈中 rxrpc_notify_socket() 与 rxrpc_recvmsg() 之间的竞态条件。原有代码在通知 socket 前通过检查 call->recvmsg_link 链表是否为空来跳过加锁和关中断的快速路径，但该检查与 rxrpc_recvmsg() 丢弃空调用（无排队数据）的操作可能并发执行，导致竞争。补丁直接移除了该 `list_empty` 短路判断，确保始终走完整的加锁通知流程。影响范围仅限用户态 AF_RXRPC 套接字，内核 AFS 文件系统驱动不经过此路径。",
      "tags": [
        "Socket",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14643469,
      "title": "[net,v3,07/11] rxrpc: Fix oob challenge leak in cleanup after notification failure",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260624163819.3017002-8-dhowells@redhat.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624163819.3017002-8-dhowells@redhat.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624163819.3017002-8-dhowells@redhat.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "539624238d557b3af1c2ef53999f1076e454174f",
      "commitRef": "092275882aec4a70ba55c3efb66fff947c81656a",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "David Howells",
      "date": "2026-06-24T16:38:14",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 rxrpc（AFS远程过程调用协议）子系统中一个连接引用计数泄漏的缺陷。具体将 rxrpc_notify_socket_oob() 的返回值从 void 改为 bool，使其在 skb 入队失败时能向上层返回错误状态；并在 rxrpc_post_challenge() 中相应增加 queued 标记，确保在 CHALLENGE 通知失败时正确释放之前获取的连接引用，避免因异常路径未清理导致的连接对象泄漏。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "Socket",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "medium",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14643466,
      "title": "[net,v3,04/11] afs: Fix further netns teardown to cancel the preallocation charger",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260624163819.3017002-5-dhowells@redhat.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624163819.3017002-5-dhowells@redhat.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624163819.3017002-5-dhowells@redhat.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "fcb0ebb4980b6b5de62d3e688a2c771473ad643b",
      "commitRef": "2daf8ac812c3d78c642fe7652f62e29df5e3da20",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "David Howells",
      "date": "2026-06-24T16:38:11",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 AFS 文件系统在网络命名空间（netns）拆除时的资源清理竞争问题。AFS 通过 RxRPC 协议（基于 UDP）通信，其预分配充电工作项（charge_preallocation_work）可能在首次取消后被 I/O 线程中的来电重新入队。修复方法是在将 socket listen 设为 0 并刷新工作队列后，再次调用 cancel_work_sync 确保该工作项彻底停止，避免 netns 拆除过程中出现资源泄漏或 UAF 问题。改动仅 5 行，属于 AFS 文件系统层面的 netns 清理逻辑修正，而非核心网络栈改动。",
      "tags": [
        "Socket",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "low",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14643183,
      "title": "[V2,net,3/4] net: hns3: fix permanent link down deadlock after reset",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260624141319.271439-4-shaojijie@huawei.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624141319.271439-4-shaojijie@huawei.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624141319.271439-4-shaojijie@huawei.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "3a276cd25682df0c636621da8a718742e3cc1f7c",
      "commitRef": "c711f6d1cee955e04d1cd1f76cd8abd024b27a72",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Jijie Shao",
      "date": "2026-06-24T14:13:18",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 hns3（华为海思）网卡驱动在固件托管 PHY 拓扑下，因 ethtool 配置序列触发的永久 Link Down 死锁问题。当用户先关闭自协商并强制不匹配速率，再重新开启自协商时，内核会传入 SPEED_UNKNOWN(0xffffffff) 给驱动；驱动在 reset 恢复阶段因 MAC 缓存的 autoneg 状态未与 PHY 同步，将 0xffffffff 写入硬件寄存器，导致 MAC 状态机冻结。修复方案是在 hclge_cfg_mac_speed_dup_h() 中过滤掉 SPEED_UNKNOWN/DUPLEX_UNKNOWN，避免污染缓存的合法配置；并在 hclge_set_autoneg() 成功调用后同步保存 req_autoneg 状态，确保 reset 后 MAC 与 PHY 状态一致。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
